  "body": "If the latest event in a thread is edited, the edit is not taken into account when calculating the thread summary.\r\n\r\nThis would happen if you have:\r\n\r\n1. A root event (`A`).\r\n2. A threaded event (`B`).\r\n3. An edit to `B` (`C`).\r\n\r\nThe summary shows `B` as the latest event instead of `C`.",
